lling in the rest of the top of the wall with 1-1/2\" thick polyisocyanurate insulation. If you want to use solid wood blocking you can enter pricing for that in the next green box; however, you will have to override the program each time you select solid wood blocking by deleting lineal footage for default blocking and manually enter lineal footage for alternate wood blocking. This price is per lineal foot. Provide alternate labor rates if required.", "extras": {}}'::jsonb,1),
