Price": 160.85, "LaborPerUnit": 0, "Labor Rate": 45.0}, {"Description": "ATR Hub 8x8x14", "Price": 374.35, "LaborPerUnit": 0, "Labor Rate": 0.0}, {"Description": "ATR Hub 8x8x30", "Price": 465.2, "LaborPerUnit": 0, "Labor Rate": 0.0}], "help": "The program use counter flashing for one of the terminations on curbs. To complete the program calculation you will need to provide a lineal foot price for counter flashing here. If you have any other sheet metal items you want to have pricing listed on, you can provide that here. Provide alternate labor rates for sheet metal work if required.", "extras": {}}'::jsonb,3),
  ('non_dl:masonry','non_dl','Masonry','{"columns": ["Description", "Price", "LaborPerUnit", "Labor Rate"], "rows": [{"Description": "Remove Only", "Price": 0.0, "LaborPerUnit": 0.1, "Labor Rate": 45.0}, {"Description": "Mortar Mix", "Price": 0.0, "LaborPerUnit": 0.3, "Labor Rate": 45.0}, {"Description": "Replace Capstones", "Price": 0.0, "LaborPerUnit": 0, "Labor Rate": 45.0}], "help": "Please provide the price you pay for mortar mix, per 80lb. bag and the price for any clay tile capstones you might find you need to replace. The program will use the mortar mix price to determine the cost of re-laying capstones on top of a parapet wall. If individual capstones have to replaced you will have to enter a quantity. Provide alternate labor rates if required.", "extras": {}}'::jsonb,4),
  ('non_dl:subcontractors','non_dl','Subcontractors','{"columns": ["Description", "Price", "LaborPerUnit", "Labor Rate"], "rows": [{"Description": "HVAC", "Price": 0.0, "LaborPerUnit": 0, "Labor Rate": 45.0}, {"Description": "Sheet Metal", "Price": 0.0, "LaborPerUnit": 0, "Labor Rate": 45.0}, {"Description": "Masonry", "Price": 0.0, "LaborPerUnit": 0, "Labor Rate": 45.0}, {"Description": "Guttering", "Price": 8.5, "LaborPerUnit": 0, "Labor Rate": 45.0}], "help": "If you have sub-contractors that do work for you on a regular basis and you have standard rates that they charge for work you can enter those rates here, either for an hourly rate or a lineal foot rate, or what ever rate is appropriate. If you have a unit cost for those services or other services you would want to add you can enter them here. Provide alternate labor rates if required.", "extras": {}}'::jsonb,5),
  ('non_dl:3rd_party_services','non_dl','3rd Party Services','{"columns": ["Description", "Price", "LaborPerUnit", "Labor Rate"], "rows": [{"Description": "Crane", "Price": 0.0, "LaborPerUnit": 0, "Labor Rate": 150.0}, {"Description": "Landfill", "Price": 0.0, "LaborPerUnit": 1, "Labor Rate": 85.0}, {"Description": "Dumpster", "Price": 850.0, "LaborPerUnit": 0, "Labor Rate": 45.0}, {"Description": "Vacuum Service", "Price": 30.0, "LaborPerUnit": 0, "Labor Rate": 45.0}, {"Description": "Set Up Charge", "Price": 0.0, "LaborPerUnit": 0, "Labor Rate": 45.0}], "help": "You can provide pricing for various services you use on a regular basis. For the tear off screen you need to provide the program with disposal cost pricing. Please select whether you use roll off units or dump trucks. Then enter the # of yards of materials you can realistically get in your disposal unit. In the pricing column you need to give a price for your disposal cost per roll off unit or dump truck. You could and should include landfill costs unless you want to manually enter this information separately. Provide alternate labor rates if required.", "extras": {"dumpster_or_dump_truck": "Dumpster", "yardage": 30}}'::jsonb,6),
  ('non_dl:preset_custom_applications','non_dl','Preset Custom Applications','{"columns": ["Description", "Price", "LaborPerUnit", "Labor Rate"], "rows": [{"Description": "Plentum Parapet wall vent", "Price": 102.9, "LaborPerUnit": 1.5, "Labor Rate": 45.0}, {"Description": "Standard Roof Hatch", "Price": 978.75, "LaborPerUnit": 10, "Labor Rate": 45.0}, {"Description": "Hatch With Rails", "Price": 1715.62, "LaborPerUnit": 15, "Labor Rate": 45.0}, {"Description": "Straight up Ladder", "Price": 3500.0, "LaborPerUnit": 20, "Labor Rate": 45.0}, {"Description": "Ladder W/ Platform &", "Price": 4200.0, "LaborPerUnit": 30, "Labor Rate": 45.0}], "help": "If you have a custom application you provide to your customers and you have a unit cost for that application you can enter that rate here. The rate will show up under Customized Contractor Applications in the bid program. Provide alternate labor rates if required.", "extras": {}}'::jsonb,7)
